- lean_nominalsubtypes.event_first: value0.box.value.payload checked by NominalSubtypes.plusOne; value0.box.value.digit < 3; value0.choices.values[*]?.ok checked by NominalSubtypes.plusOne; value0.choices.values[*]?.error checked by NominalSubtypes.plusTwo
- lean_nominalsubtypes.event_second: value0.box.value.payload checked by NominalSubtypes.plusTwo; value0.box.value.digit < 3; value0.choices.values[*]?.ok checked by NominalSubtypes.plusTwo; value0.choices.values[*]?.error checked by NominalSubtypes.plusOne
- lean_nominalsubtypes.event_value: result.box.value.payload projects the Subtype base value; result.box.value.digit < 3; result.choices.values[*]?.ok projects the Subtype base value; result.choices.values[*]?.error projects the Subtype base value
- lean_nominalsubtypes.first: value0.payload checked by NominalSubtypes.plusOne; value0.digit < 3
- lean_nominalsubtypes.group_values: result[*]?.payload projects the Subtype base value; result[*]?.digit < 3
